              "content": "Get the definitions for ads and organic metrics available across both synchronous and asynchronous report endpoints.\nThe `display_name` attribute will match how the metric is named in our native tools like Ads Manager.\nSee <a href='/docs/content/analytics/'>Organic Analytics</a> and <a href='/docs/ads/ad-analytics-reporting/'>Ads Analytics</a> for more information.",
